{"5437500":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Order, My Lord! Tidy Up the Dungeon","steam_appid":5437500,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5437500\/extras\/2061c1e5c9fa0e6e4815d0a36351c011.avif?t=1793655619\" alt=\"THE DARK LORD JUST WANTS TO REST\" width=1170 height=240 \/><\/span><br><br>You are the Dark Lord. You have returned from a long mission, and you want just one thing: to sit on your throne.<br><br>Unfortunately, while you were away, a band of heroes broke into your dungeon and left your domain in complete disarray. To make matters worse, <strong>your dungeon is alive—and refuses to let you into the Throne Room until everything is back where it belongs.<\/strong><br><br><strong>4,500 objects. Ten rooms. One Dark Lord with very little patience.<\/strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5437500\/extras\/42084f8509e6132b97a21485761bc945.poster.avif?t=1793655619\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5437500\/extras\/42084f8509e6132b97a21485761bc945.webm?t=1793655619\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5437500\/extras\/42084f8509e6132b97a21485761bc945.mp4?t=1793655619\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COLLECT, SORT AND RESTORE<\/h2><br>Explore ten themed rooms filled with weapons, potions, treasures, books, bones, crystals and all manner of monstrous belongings.<br><br>Pick up objects, gather matching ones in your inventory and discover where each belongs. Every collection has its place, but finding it is part of the challenge.<br><br><strong>Every room is available from the start.<\/strong> You decide where to begin and how to tackle the mess.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5437500\/extras\/34136baded05428bd0547de1add3927c.poster.avif?t=1793655619\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5437500\/extras\/34136baded05428bd0547de1add3927c.webm?t=1793655619\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5437500\/extras\/34136baded05428bd0547de1add3927c.mp4?t=1793655619\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A PLACE FOR EVERYTHING<\/h2><br>Find the right shelf, put each object in its place and watch empty spaces gradually become neatly arranged collections.<br><br>Every correctly placed object rewards you with Favor, which you can spend on upgrades to make your work easier.<br><br>Complete a family of objects to discover their curious stories and descriptions, revealing some rather questionable details about your dungeon's inhabitants.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5437500\/extras\/f820b9efda2f3eb62318fb43dceaae2c.poster.avif?t=1793655619\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5437500\/extras\/f820b9efda2f3eb62318fb43dceaae2c.webm?t=1793655619\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5437500\/extras\/f820b9efda2f3eb62318fb43dceaae2c.mp4?t=1793655619\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5437500\/extras\/e1a5b7ba4645f1f9716f944e710486d7.avif?t=1793655619\" alt=\"MORE ORDER, MORE POWER\" width=1170 height=240 \/><\/span><br><br>Who said tidying a dungeon had to be done the traditional way?<br><br>As you restore the rooms, you unlock and upgrade <strong>ten abilities<\/strong> that transform the way you play.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Resonance:<\/strong> find copies of the object you are looking for, even through walls.<br><\/li><li><strong>Destiny Vision:<\/strong> discover the room, the piece of furniture and, finally, the exact spot where an object belongs.<br><\/li><li><strong>Infernal Hand:<\/strong> magically draw identical objects from anywhere in the dungeon into your inventory.<br><\/li><li><strong>Infernal Portal:<\/strong> send objects straight to their respective rooms.<br><\/li><li><strong>Efficiency upgrades:<\/strong> increase your speed, carrying capacity and throwing power.<\/li><\/ul><br>The more you organize, the more tools you have to deal with the remaining mess.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5437500\/extras\/5b3e6f755201e36066d85d8c68bab34a.poster.avif?t=1793655619\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5437500\/extras\/5b3e6f755201e36066d85d8c68bab34a.webm?t=1793655619\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5437500\/extras\/5b3e6f755201e36066d85d8c68bab34a.mp4?t=1793655619\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5437500\/extras\/4be7670bdd4dd94c132e07b65b95e6f9.avif?t=1793655619\" alt=\"LEAVE THE DIRTY WORK TO YOUR SERVANTS\" width=1170 height=240 \/><\/span><br><br>You are the Dark Lord. Why should you have to do absolutely everything yourself?<br><br>As you progress, you can enlist the help of <strong>up to three goblins and three skeletons<\/strong>, each with a different job.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Goblins:<\/strong> pick up objects that are in the wrong room and carry them to the room where they belong.<br><\/li><li><strong>Skeletons:<\/strong> finish collections you have already started, putting the remaining objects in their proper places.<\/li><\/ul><br>Assign your helpers where you need them most, improve their abilities and put them to work while you turn your attention to other rooms.<br><br>But do not expect them to solve all your problems: <strong>you are still the one in charge of restoring the dungeon.<\/strong><br><br><strong>Your throne is waiting. A pity you have to tidy up 4,500 things before you can sit down.<\/strong>","about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5437500\/extras\/2061c1e5c9fa0e6e4815d0a36351c011.avif?t=1793655619\" alt=\"THE DARK LORD JUST WANTS TO REST\" width=1170 height=240 \/><\/span><br><br>You are the Dark Lord. You have returned from a long mission, and you want just one thing: to sit on your throne.<br><br>Unfortunately, while you were away, a band of heroes broke into your dungeon and left your domain in complete disarray. To make matters worse, <strong>your dungeon is alive—and refuses to let you into the Throne Room until everything is back where it belongs.<\/strong><br><br><strong>4,500 objects. Ten rooms. One Dark Lord with very little patience.<\/strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5437500\/extras\/42084f8509e6132b97a21485761bc945.poster.avif?t=1793655619\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5437500\/extras\/42084f8509e6132b97a21485761bc945.webm?t=1793655619\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5437500\/extras\/42084f8509e6132b97a21485761bc945.mp4?t=1793655619\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COLLECT, SORT AND RESTORE<\/h2><br>Explore ten themed rooms filled with weapons, potions, treasures, books, bones, crystals and all manner of monstrous belongings.<br><br>Pick up objects, gather matching ones in your inventory and discover where each belongs. Every collection has its place, but finding it is part of the challenge.<br><br><strong>Every room is available from the start.<\/strong> You decide where to begin and how to tackle the mess.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5437500\/extras\/34136baded05428bd0547de1add3927c.poster.avif?t=1793655619\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5437500\/extras\/34136baded05428bd0547de1add3927c.webm?t=1793655619\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5437500\/extras\/34136baded05428bd0547de1add3927c.mp4?t=1793655619\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A PLACE FOR EVERYTHING<\/h2><br>Find the right shelf, put each object in its place and watch empty spaces gradually become neatly arranged collections.<br><br>Every correctly placed object rewards you with Favor, which you can spend on upgrades to make your work easier.<br><br>Complete a family of objects to discover their curious stories and descriptions, revealing some rather questionable details about your dungeon's inhabitants.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=